    "Lorelei"  => "ICE / HAIL (E4). Every mon holds Never-Melt-Ice and can set Hail. Weavile/Lapras Perish-Song traps; Jynx/Tangrowth Sleep Powder + Ice Punch; Mamoswine/Slowbro Slack Off recovery. Ice STAB everywhere (4x on Dragon/Ground/Flying/Grass). Set Hail, chip, click Ice. Keep your Ice-weak mons back; wall the Ice with Water/Steel/Fire.",
    "Bruno"    => "FIGHTING (E4). Black Belt boosts Fighting. Scizor/Heracross Swords Dance then Close Combat/X-Scissor sweeps; Marowak/Hitmonchan Dynamic Punch + Bonemerang; Machamp/Electivire mixed punches; Magnezone/Onix Lock-On + Zap Cannon. Fighting is walled by Ghost/Flying/Psychic/Fairy - lead those. Revenge the SD sweeper before it snowballs.",
    "Agatha"   => "GHOST TRAP/STALL (E4). Spell Tag Ghosts. Gengar/Houndoom + Wobbuffet/Gengar spam DESTINY BOND (do NOT KO them with your wincon - chip/status instead), Wobbuffet Counter/Mirror Coat punishes attacks, Snorlax/Gengar Curse+Rest stalls. Ghost STAB. Wear them down with hazards/status; never trade your sweeper into Destiny Bond.",
    "Lance"    => "DRAGON (E4). Dragon Fang Dragons. Togekiss/Dragonite Moonblast/Outrage; Tyranitar/Aerodactyl Brave Bird/Head Smash + Agility; Typhlosion/Dragonair Dragon Dance + Fire Blast; Porygon2/Kingdra DD + Recover. Dragon STAB is walled by Fairy/Steel - lead those and revenge with Ice/Fairy. Watch the Agility/DD sweepers.",
    "BlueExpert" => "CHAMPION OFFENSE. Venusaur/Mamoswine (Thick Fat) Stealth Rock lead; Chandelure/Volcarona (SHADOW TAG - it TRAPS your switch! + Quiver Dance, Focus Sash) is the main sweeper; Blastoise/Scizor (Technician Bullet Punch/Aqua Jet PRIORITY + Swords Dance); Porygon-Z/Noivern (Adaptability Boomburst nuke); Sylveon/Dragonite (Pixilate Extreme Speed priority); Mew. Beware Shadow Tag trapping and layered priority - keep resists healthy, revenge the Quiver Dance sweeper fast.",
    "BlueRemix"  => "CHAMPION HAZARD OFFENSE. Shuckle/Klefki (Prankster STICKY WEB + hazards, fast lead - drops your Speed) sets up; Magnezone/Cofagrigus traps Steels; Metagross/Dhelmise Steelworker band; Garchomp/Weavile fast physical + Ice; Sylveon/Noivern Pixilate priority; Slaking/Dragonite (Multiscale, no Truant) Extreme Speed. Clear Sticky Web (spin/defog) or play around the -Speed; revenge the priority sweepers, don't get chip-trapped.",
  }

  module_function

  def plan(n); PLANS[n] || "Play type advantages, set up when safe, revenge with priority/scarf."; end

  # Field as {name => spec}. From reports/<tag>/field_specs.json if present, else the
  # base 10 (extracted from the save + my specs).
  def field(tag_dir = nil)
    f = tag_dir && File.join(tag_dir, 'field_specs.json')
    if f && File.exist?(f)
      ClaudeClient::PARSE.call(File.read(f)).transform_values { |t| t.map { |m| Editor.normalize(m) } }
    else
      SpecExtract.all
    end
  end
end
